        <mxCell id="worker_node_0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.4;align=left;spacingLeft=45;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 12.5px; color: #065F46;&quot;&gt;Retry-Node 0 (Assigned Token Sector 0)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; color: #047857;&quot;&gt;Autonomous discovery: Sweeps partitions of pod-order-a and pod-order-c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 9.5px; color: #065F46;&quot;&gt;• Re-executes transactions &amp;amp; drops bucket partitions via O(1) tombstone&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
